{
  "name": "Competitor page change monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Competitor page change monitor\n\n**What it does**\nOnce a day, fetches your competitors' pricing (or any) pages, turns them into clean text, fingerprints the text with SHA-256 and compares it with yesterday's fingerprint in Google Sheets. When something changed, OpenAI explains what changed in plain English and Slack gets the summary. Cosmetic changes are filtered out.\n\n**You need**\nGoogle Sheets, OpenAI and Slack credentials.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Connect the three credentials.\n2. Put your spreadsheet ID in both sheet nodes and list competitor pages in the sheet.\n3. Run once to record the first fingerprints, then activate.\n\nBuilt by AI Strike Force, aistrikeforce.com",
        "height": 680,
        "width": 500
      },
      "id": "57873cd1-bd97-4351-a05c-65455ba6ec79",
      "name": "Competitor page change monitor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Edit me\nSpreadsheet ID in **Read competitor pages** and **Save the new fingerprint**. Tab **Competitors** with columns `name, url, last_hash, last_text, last_checked, last_changed, last_error`.",
        "height": 270,
        "width": 210,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "4ae0346e-539d-4f37-a0c4-75b60d47e116",
      "name": "Edit me: sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 7
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "5f29a01d-01b1-43ab-a932-2af64d4bb114",
      "name": "Every day at 7:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        0,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Competitors",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "80f529dd-573e-49df-a7d6-a66ab86bd16c",
      "name": "Read competitor pages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        220,
        300
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "User-Agent",
              "value": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/126.0 Safari/537.36"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "text",
              "outputPropertyName": "html"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "e936c7b5-bc83-4bc5-ab88-77c245b95edc",
      "name": "Fetch the page",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        440,
        300
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Raw HTML changes on every load (scripts, tracking IDs, security tokens), so we compare visible text only.\nconst MAX = 20000; // Google Sheets cells hold 50,000 characters, keep well below\n\nconst toText = (html) => String(html || '')\n  .replace(/<(script|style|noscript|svg|template)[\\s\\S]*?<\\/\\1>/gi, ' ')\n  .replace(/<!--[\\s\\S]*?-->/g, ' ')\n  .replace(/<br\\s*\\/?>/gi, '\\n')\n  .replace(/<\\/(p|div|li|h[1-6]|tr|td|th|section|article|header|footer|button|a)>/gi, '\\n')\n  .replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ')\n  .replace(/&nbsp;/g, ' ').replace(/&amp;/g, '&').replace(/&lt;/g, '<').replace(/&gt;/g, '>')\n  .replace(/&quot;/g, '\"').replace(/&#0?39;|&rsquo;|&lsquo;/g, \"'\").replace(/&euro;/g, '€').replace(/&pound;/g, '£')\n  .split('\\n').map((l) => l.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ').trim()).filter((l) => l.length > 1)\n  .join('\\n')\n  .slice(0, MAX);\n\nreturn $input.all().map((item, i) => {\n  const row = $('Read competitor pages').itemMatching(i).json;\n  const oldText = String(row.last_text || '');\n  const fetched = !item.json.error && item.json.html;\n  // If the fetch failed, reuse yesterday's text so a timeout is never reported as a change.\n  const text = fetched ? toText(item.json.html) : oldText;\n\n  const oldLines = new Set(oldText.split('\\n'));\n  const newLines = new Set(text.split('\\n'));\n  const added = [...newLines].filter((l) => !oldLines.has(l));\n  const removed = [...oldLines].filter((l) => !newLines.has(l));\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      name: row.name || row.url,\n      url: row.url,\n      text,\n      old_hash: String(row.last_hash || ''),\n      last_changed: row.last_changed || '',\n      added: added.join('\\n').slice(0, 6000),\n      removed: removed.join('\\n').slice(0, 6000),\n      fetch_error: fetched ? '' : String(item.json.error?.message || 'empty response').slice(0, 200),\n    },\n  };\n});"
      },
      "id": "27c88994-4f94-4f7e-a764-979cb4ef6b44",
      "name": "Clean the page to text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "action": "hash",
        "type": "SHA256",
        "value": "={{ $json.text }}",
        "dataPropertyName": "hash",
        "encoding": "hex"
      },
      "id": "29cec1cc-fea4-48bd-a23f-9eaded54710f",
      "name": "Fingerprint the text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.crypto",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        880,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "YOUR_SHEET_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "Competitors",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
            "last_hash": "={{ $json.fetch_error && !$json.old_hash ? '' : $json.hash }}",
            "last_text": "={{ $json.text }}",
            "last_checked": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
            "last_changed": "={{ $json.old_hash && $json.old_hash !== $json.hash ? $now.toISO() : $json.last_changed }}",
            "last_error": "={{ $json.fetch_error }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "url"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "url",
              "displayName": "url",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "last_hash",
              "displayName": "last_hash",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "last_text",
              "displayName": "last_text",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "last_checked",
              "displayName": "last_checked",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "last_changed",
              "displayName": "last_changed",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            },
            {
              "id": "last_error",
              "displayName": "last_error",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "type": "string",
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3aa4b8d7-f7b9-441e-a3e0-24ec47ed1c0f",
      "name": "Save the new fingerprint",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1100,
        140
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "name": "Google Sheets account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 3
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "had-baseline",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.old_hash }}",
              "rightValue": "",
